fleet milestone --instant <value> --id <value> --title <value>
    the COORDINATOR puts a milestone ON the roadmap; the only way work becomes dispatchable
    --instant <value>            (required) the instant holding the roadmap
    --id <value>                 (required) the milestone id, unique within the roadmap
    --title <value>              (required) what the milestone is; an untitled milestone cannot be dispatched
    --status <value>             blocked|ready|running|awaiting-ci|done|dropped (default: blocked)
    --dep <value>                a milestone id this one depends on; repeatable, and each must EXIST
    --evidence <value>           an evidence path; repeatable
    --owner <value>              informational only — readiness never reads it
    --home <value>               the record/pool store root; overrides $FLEET_HOME
    --instants-dir <value>       where instants live; overrides $FLEET_INSTANTS
    --porcelain                  machine form on stdout: tab-separated, no banner (NFR2-7)
    --help                       print this verb's derived usage and exit 0
